model new 
model deterministic off
model config fluid
model large-strain off

program threads 12

[global L=100]
block create brick 0 [L] -5 5 [-L//2] [L//2]

block cut joint-set dip 0 dip-direction 90 origin 0, 0, 0

block densify segments 5 1 5 join

block zone size edgelength 3 range pos-x 0 [L] pos-z [-L//10] [L//10] 
block zone generate-new min-edge 3 max-edge 8 grad-surface 0.1

model save "../saves/geometry"
